Seconds",16.4,"research",true,"3D Game","Pelican on a Bike：鹈鹕骑单车","Claude Code · Three.js","/zh/examples/pelican-bike-claude/","https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo/tree/main/pelican-bike","/GameMap/media/promo/chapter-3d.webp",8.2,8.8,"2D Game","Marvel Avengers: Infinity Strike","OpenGame · Phaser","/zh/examples/opengame-marvel-platformer/","https://yelonhu.github.io/OpenGame-landing-page/","/GameMap/media/promo/chapter-2d.webp",0,1.1,{"_57":26,"_60":176,"_96":177,"_98":178,"_100":179,"_102":21,"_103":104,"_105":180,"_107":181,"_109":182,"_111":183,"_113":184,"_115":185,"_117":186},{"_57":28,"_60":85,"_96":149,"_98":150,"_102":19,"_103":151,"_105":152,"_107":153,"_109":154,"_111":155,"_113":156,"_115":157,"_117":158},{"_57":30,"_60":95,"_96":97,"_98":99,"_100":101,"_102":21,"_103":104,"_105":106,"_107":108,"_109":110,"_111":112,"_113":114,"_115":116,"_117":118},"TRON: EXONIX","description","通过 Claude Code、Godot MCP、Blender MCP 和生成资产制作的霓虹 3D 占地游戏，由人工提供设计与试玩反馈。","engine","Godot 4.7 · GDScript","assetTools",[143,144,145,146,147,148],"track","category","ai-assisted","aiUse","作者记录 Claude 编写玩法、着色器、视觉特效和 UI，人工引导机制与材质。仓库包含实际 Godot 游戏、生成资产及资产生成脚本。","steps",[139,140,141,142],"tutorial",{"_58":137,"_124":138,"_134":109},"demo",{"_58":133,"_124":39,"_134":135,"_126":136},"source",{"_58":128,"_124":129,"_130":131,"_126":132},"evidence",{"_58":123,"_124":125,"_126":127},"resourceIds",[119,120,121,122],"claude-code","godot-engine","godot-mcp","mcp-for-blender","Read how the agent workflow was assembled","url","https://github.com/witnesstodark/tron-exonix/blob/master/CLAUDE.md","note","The creator’s reproducible setup record explains the AI’s implementation work, human material review, generation tools, and local launch requirements.","Open the complete Godot game project","https://github.com/witnesstodark/tron-exonix","scope","complete-project","Includes the Godot project, scripts, shaders, models, textures, audio, and generation scripts. Local play requires Godot 4.7 standard; API access is only needed to regenerate assets.","Play TRON: EXONIX","kind","playable","Creator-hosted Godot web build. Click to enter the grid, press Space to deploy, use the arrow keys to move, and Escape for the menu. A keyboard and a WebGL-capable browser are recommended.","Follow the creator’s complete workflow","https://www.top3d.ai/learn/claude-godot-mcp-3d-game","Play the web build and study territory capture, trail hazards, enemy movement, and sector progression.","Follow the creator’s tutorial from prototype through materials, audio, effects, and web export.","Read CLAUDE.md to understand the agent, Godot MCP, Blender review, and asset-generation workflow.","Open game/project.godot in Godot 4.7 and press F5; study the scripts alongside the included models, textures, and audio.","Blender","Nano Banana","PATINA","Tripo","Stable Audio","ElevenLabs","研究一款生成式动作平台游戏，包含英雄选择、战斗技能和多阶段开发简报。","Phaser 3 · TypeScript","ai-generated","这个作者发布的 OpenGame 案例把详细动作游戏提示词、在线结果和生成源码连接起来。应将实现与简报逐项比较，而不把提示词本身当成所有功能正常的证据。",[172,173,174,175],{"_58":170,"_124":163,"_134":171},{"_58":168,"_124":49,"_134":135,"_126":169},{"_58":165,"_124":166,"_126":167,"_130":131},{"_58":162,"_124":163,"_126":164},[159,160,161],"opengame","codex-browser-games","playwright-mcp","Author prompt and generation claim","https://github.com/leigest519/OpenGame#playable-demos","Listed in the authors’ single-prompt generated-game gallery, with the original platformer brief and an exact source download.","Download the exact platformer project","https://github.com/leigest519/OpenGame/raw/main/assets/downloads/demo_platformer_marvel.zip","Complete generated game archive, approximately 489.8 MB. Includes character selection and three level scenes; this is a large project download.","Play Infinity Strike","Direct author-hosted browser build. The gallery lists WASD / Space for movement, K for attack, and Q for the special skill.","Read the platformer generation prompt","prompt","Play the browser build and compare the selectable heroes and their combat feedback.","Read the original brief and turn its movement, skills, stages, and boss requirements into a short checklist.","Open the exact source archive and follow character selection into the three level scenes.","Choose one requirement to revise with an agent, then replay the relevant stage and check for regressions.","Moonlight & Mayhem","用 Codex 制作的 3D 博物馆劫案：救出两只浣熊队友、躲避安保、叠起小队，偷走金色沙丁鱼。","Three.js · JavaScript",[204],"Simon Willison 记录了向 Codex 提供游戏简报和图像生成权限，再提出视觉缺陷修复的过程。公开项目包含游戏、生成纹理和开发对话。",[200,201,202,203],{"_58":197,"_124":198,"_134":199},{"_58":195,"_124":53,"_134":135,"_126":196},{"_58":192,"_124":193,"_130":131,"_126":194},{"_58":189,"_124":190,"_126":191},[187,188,160],"codex","threejs","Read the published Codex transcript","https://github.com/simonw/raccoon-heist-codex/blob/main/transcript.md","The creator links this development record from the build account; it accompanies the game source rather than a generator-only repository.","Open the complete game project","https://github.com/simonw/raccoon-heist-codex/","Actual game source, committed textures, vendored Three.js, build notes, and transcript. No build step is required; use a local static HTTP server to run the repository.","Play Moonlight & Mayhem","Desktop: WASD or arrows to move, E to interact, Space or Shift to dash, Escape to pause. Mobile uses a touch stick and action buttons. Requires a WebGL-capable browser.","Read the creator’s build and fix log","https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/7/moonlight-mayhem/","build-log","Play the heist and trace crew rescue, security detection, interactions, and escape.","Read the creator’s build account and compare the original brief with the result.","Follow the transcript and commit history to study scene construction, generated art, and the visual bug fix.","Serve the complete repository locally, then study one mechanic and its supporting assets.","gpt-image-2",{"_206":207},"documents",{"_208":209,"_210":211},"en"